<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="text-align: center; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;">Only for a limited time, special offer for Qantas Business Rewards members</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2031794577/QBR+email+header.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2033257980/eDM_Hero_QBR_B2B_680x400_v2.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="680"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table class="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 26px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Now it's even more rewarding to do business</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Hi &lt; name &gt;,</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">If you have business travel coming up, then be sure to take advantage of this exclusive offer from Qantas Business Rewards.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Right now, your business will earn&nbsp;<b>500 bonus Qantas Points</b>&nbsp;on every eligible domestic and international flight booked by 11.59pm AEDT 25 February 2020, for travel until 14 February 2021.* The more flights you book, the more rewards your business gets.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h3" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Fly higher with double Status Credits</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">What's more, the Qantas Frequent Flyer could earn&nbsp;<b>double Status Credits~</b>&nbsp;for themselves when travelling on eligible Qantas operated flights. Simply add your ABN and the traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number to all bookings to be rewarded.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/exclusive-offers/QBES138.html?utm_source=qis&amp;utm_medium=edm&amp;utm_campaign=back2bizfeb&amp;utm_content=registernow%20&amp;utm_term=registernow" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 16px; height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/exclusive-offers/QBES138.html?utm_source=qis&amp;ut